openskin includes code ported from better-claude
https://github.com/midudev/better-claude

- hooks/meters/tokens.tsx includes code from better-claude's token-meter
  (plugins/token-meter/hooks/register.tsx).
- hooks/meters/context.tsx includes code from better-claude's context-meter
  (plugins/context-meter/hooks/register.tsx).
- hooks/meters/usage.tsx includes code from better-claude's sub-meter
  (plugins/sub-meter/hooks/register.tsx).
- types/index.d.ts includes the Tokens, Fill and Limit types from those
  mods' types/index.d.ts.
- tests/meters.test.tsx adapts fixtures and test worlds from those mods'
  hooks/register.test.tsx.

